@using VeloxDev.WorkflowSystem
@using System.ComponentModel
@implements IDisposable

@* Generic catch-all body rendered inside the TemplateNodeView card when no dedicated
   body view exists for the node type. Deliberately empty: the card chrome — the neutral
   slate accent, the title row, the surface and the hairline — all come from
   TemplateNodeView, so a foreign node still lands on the same visual family as the four
   known types without this file claiming to know anything about it. *@
